"memastikan kamu mendapatkan pengalaman terbaik dengan Qiskit Function "
"kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We are always looking to improve our product and we welcome your "
"suggestions! If you have ideas on how we can enhance our services or "
"features you'd like to see, please send us your thoughts at "
"support@qedma.com.\n"
msgstr ""
